---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /izbira/
title: "Cene poročnega fotografiranja – paketi | Jan Zorič, poročni fotograf"
description: "Koliko stane poročni fotograf? Paketi MINI (500 €), MIDI (750 €) in MAXI (1000 €): ure, število fotografij, galerija in fotografije z dronom."
bodyClass: page-pricing
---
{%- from "macros.njk" import label %}
{#- Package contents and prices live in src/_data/paketi.yml. -#}
<h1 class="visually-hidden">Cene in paketi poročnega fotografiranja</h1>

<div class="band">
<img class="flora flora--fern" src="/flora/fern.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" eleventy:ignore>
<div class="packages" id="paketi">
  {{ label("01", "Paketi") }}
  {%- for p in paketi.paketi %}
  <article class="package" data-reveal aria-labelledby="paket-{{ p.ime | lower }}">
    <h2 class="package__name" id="paket-{{ p.ime | lower }}"><span class="package__label">opcija</span> {{ p.ime }}</h2>
    <div class="package__lists">
      <ul class="package__base">
        {%- for item in p.osnova %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <span class="package__dash" aria-hidden="true">------------</span>
      <ul class="package__bonus">
        {%- for item in p.bonus %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="package__price">
      <p class="price">{{ p.cena }}</p>
      <a class="bracket-link" href="/kontakt/?paket={{ p.ime }}">[TEGA BI IMELA]<span class="visually-hidden"> – paket {{ p.ime }}</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
  <p class="footnote" data-reveal>{{ paketi.opomba }}</p>
</div>
</div>

<section class="nothing-fits" data-reveal>
  {{ label("02", "Po meri") }}
  <h2 class="display display--center">NIČ OD TEGA VAMA NE USTREZA?</h2>
  <p class="lead">Se zgodi.<br>Če potrebujeta kaj vmes, več ur ali imata malo drugačne načrte, <a class="underline-link" href="/kontakt/">mi pišita.</a></p>
</section>

<section class="steps" aria-labelledby="kako-najame">
  {{ label("03", "Postopek") }}
  <h2 class="steps__title" id="kako-najame" data-reveal>KAKO SE ME NAJAME?</h2>
  <ol class="steps__list">
    <li data-reveal><span class="step-num">01.</span> <strong>IZBERITA.</strong>
      <p><a class="underline-link" href="#paketi">Poglejta pakete.</a> V vseh dobita istega fotografa.</p></li>
    <li data-reveal><span class="step-num">02.</span> <strong>PIŠITA.</strong>
      <p><a class="underline-link" href="/kontakt/">Sporočita</a> mi datum in lokacijo, jaz pa preverim, če sem še prost.</p></li>
    <li data-reveal><span class="step-num">03.</span> <strong>GREMO NA KAVO.</strong>
      <p>Ali pivo. Ali Zoom. Se spoznamo in pogovorimo o vajini poroki.</p></li>
    <li data-reveal><span class="step-num">04.</span> <strong>AKONTACIJA.</strong>
      <p>Plačata akontacijo in datum je rezerviran.</p></li>
    <li data-reveal><span class="step-num">05.</span> <strong>POROKA.</strong></li>
    <li data-reveal><span class="step-num">06.</span> <strong>FOTOGRAFIJE.</strong>
      <p>Najkasneje v 30 dneh dobita <a class="underline-link" href="/portfolio/">končno galerijo.</a></p></li>
  </ol>
</section>

{#- Questions & answers live in src/_data/vprasanja.yml -#}
<section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-naslov">
  {{ label("04", "Vprašanja") }}
  <h2 class="steps__title" id="faq-naslov" data-reveal>POGOSTA VPRAŠANJA</h2>
  <dl class="faq__list">
    {%- for q in vprasanja.vprasanja %}
    <div class="faq__item" data-reveal>
      <dt>{{ q.vprasanje }}</dt>
      <dd>{{ q.odgovor }}</dd>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for q in vprasanja.vprasanja %}
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q.vprasanje | json | safe }},
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ q.odgovor | json | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<section class="outro" data-reveal>
  <p class="outro__big">OSTANE SAMO ŠE ENA STVAR.</p>
  <p><a class="bracket-link bracket-link--big" href="/kontakt/">[GREMO NA KAVO]</a></p>
</section>
